WEBVTT

00:19.820 --> 00:24.124
The wound inside
my sealed memories

00:24.124 --> 00:28.762
When it silently touches the heart

00:28.762 --> 00:36.470
Tears of loneliness behind
the gentle smile

00:36.470 --> 00:41.275
I seek boundless strength

00:41.275 --> 00:52.086
I continue to run up with
what I believe in

00:52.086 --> 00:54.088
I want to protect

00:54.088 --> 00:56.457
I want to believe

00:56.457 --> 01:00.761
all the reasons for that smile

01:00.761 --> 01:05.132
The heat and the love

01:05.132 --> 01:09.370
I accept them all

01:09.370 --> 01:13.007
I won't let go of your hand again

01:13.007 --> 01:21.608
Aiming towards that light...

01:30.657 --> 01:34.058
Previously on Shonen Onmyouji...

01:51.111 --> 01:53.747
If Akiko had entered
the palace,

01:53.747 --> 01:56.717
the curse might bring harm
to the Mikado.

01:56.717 --> 01:59.208
Then who was the one
who married the Mikado?!

01:59.386 --> 02:02.089
Lord Michinaga has
another daughter,

02:02.089 --> 02:05.149
Princess Shouko, who's born
of a different mother.

02:05.626 --> 02:07.787
They look almost identical.

02:09.663 --> 02:12.962
The Time of Shadows
Over North Star

02:16.036 --> 02:18.266
I will become the ruler.

02:19.540 --> 02:21.531
I will dominate the earth...

02:21.842 --> 02:24.276
And have enough power to
control the heavens.

02:25.212 --> 02:28.807
I will seize the throne by
any means.

02:44.231 --> 02:47.758
Look!
Prince Atsuyasu is laughing!

02:51.572 --> 02:53.802
What an adorable face!

03:18.699 --> 03:20.963
Is something wrong,
Princess Nagako?

03:21.602 --> 03:23.504
It's cold here.

03:23.504 --> 03:25.233
Let's go back inside.

03:32.746 --> 03:34.839
Who... are you?

03:35.782 --> 03:37.613
My name is Kazane.

03:42.956 --> 03:45.789
Hello there...
Hello...

03:46.193 --> 03:47.717
It's Father...

03:49.496 --> 03:51.987
I'm afraid to hold him
too tightly.

03:59.139 --> 04:02.165
I guess it's a happy thing
to have a new baby.

04:02.609 --> 04:04.770
Isn't that a happy thing?

04:04.945 --> 04:07.447
Yoshimasa always
looked happy...

04:07.447 --> 04:09.312
when his sons were born.

04:09.416 --> 04:10.781
Even at my birth?

04:10.951 --> 04:12.186
Well, of course.

04:12.186 --> 04:14.711
It has been about 10 years
since his last son was born.

04:16.423 --> 04:17.913
Good morning, Masahiro.

04:18.325 --> 04:22.284
Your coals are running out,
so I brought you some.

04:23.697 --> 04:25.164
Thanks, Akiko.

04:26.900 --> 04:29.164
What were you talking about?

04:31.438 --> 04:32.837
Really?

04:32.906 --> 04:35.175
Prince Atsuyasu has entered
the palace.

04:35.175 --> 04:37.075
He is 3 months old.

04:37.444 --> 04:40.314
The Emperor is overjoyed
that he finally has a son...

04:40.314 --> 04:43.112
and a future heir
to the throne.

04:43.784 --> 04:47.618
Princess Akiko could have
given the Mikado an heir...

04:47.955 --> 04:49.189
Because something happened,

04:49.189 --> 04:52.920
another princess took your place
and married the Mikado instead.

04:54.061 --> 04:55.829
Princess Shouko...

04:55.829 --> 05:00.061
She may only be
the Emperor's concubine, but...

05:00.234 --> 05:02.964
she'll be crowned as
the empress soon.

05:03.170 --> 05:05.570
I'd really wanted to meet her
just once...

05:05.939 --> 05:09.306
When she's crowned Empress,
I won't be able to see her.

05:09.876 --> 05:12.174
If you want to see her face,
we can help.

05:12.946 --> 05:15.744
Genbu can show her to you
through a mirror of water.

05:16.016 --> 05:17.779
He's really good at that.

05:18.418 --> 05:20.721
Hey, Genbu!
We need your help!

05:20.721 --> 05:22.689
It's okay, we can do this
some other time.

05:25.559 --> 05:26.856
Thank you, Mokkun.

05:35.269 --> 05:36.099
You called?

05:36.637 --> 05:37.433
Too late!

05:38.338 --> 05:41.000
It's freezing out here tonight...

05:41.708 --> 05:45.542
A cold is going around
so try not to get sick.

05:45.712 --> 05:46.613
Sure.

05:46.613 --> 05:47.739
See you later!

05:48.215 --> 05:49.944
It's so cold!

05:50.250 --> 05:52.586
Stop whining and start walking,
Seimei's grandson.

05:52.586 --> 05:53.883
Don't call me that!

06:01.528 --> 06:03.621
Right, there are not
many people.

06:04.264 --> 06:06.562
I guess they've got
a cold too.

06:06.967 --> 06:08.059
Oh well...

06:10.404 --> 06:14.341
Most of them have the flu and
couldn't come today, Masahiro...

06:14.341 --> 06:16.332
An annoying voice
in the morning...

06:18.712 --> 06:20.747
Toshitsugu, maybe you have
a cold too.

06:20.747 --> 06:22.738
Stay back!
We don't want to get infected!

06:24.418 --> 06:25.885
You could be right.

06:26.119 --> 06:28.053
Why don't you just
take the day off?

06:28.522 --> 06:29.656
No, I can't.

06:29.656 --> 06:31.158
I told you to stay back!

06:31.158 --> 06:33.820
Professor Tenmon is delivering
a lecture today...

06:34.761 --> 06:37.491
There's no way
I'm going to miss that.

06:38.498 --> 06:39.726
Oh, I see.

06:40.434 --> 06:42.334
I'll collapse after that.

06:44.638 --> 06:46.265
Toshitsugu's truly incredible.

06:46.807 --> 06:48.206
He's finally gone.

06:52.045 --> 06:53.672
What... What's wrong?

06:55.349 --> 06:57.749
Stay back!
We'll catch your cold!

06:58.952 --> 07:01.011
You'll lose something soon.

07:02.456 --> 07:05.983
Your face has the mark of someone
who will lose something.

07:06.326 --> 07:07.816
You'd better be on your guard...

07:12.399 --> 07:13.661
Lose something...

07:14.901 --> 07:18.234
But, the only important thing
I have to lose...

07:18.405 --> 07:21.101
is this sachet
that Akiko gave me.

07:22.242 --> 07:25.040
Don't worry too much
about what he said...

07:25.379 --> 07:27.313
It's not like he's Seimei
or anything.

07:33.754 --> 07:34.550
Seiryuu.

07:37.023 --> 07:40.515
Someone is interfering with
my divination.

07:42.529 --> 07:45.098
I've only ever known
one person in the world...

07:45.098 --> 07:46.588
powerful enough to do that.

07:46.733 --> 07:48.428
Chishiki no Guuji?

07:49.536 --> 07:52.869
Has it been...
50 years already?

08:11.958 --> 08:14.290
Seimei, don't forget...

08:14.861 --> 08:18.262
If Touda's hands are ever stained
with innocent blood again...

08:18.598 --> 08:20.691
then on that day I will...

08:24.738 --> 08:27.730
Have you caught the flu?
You better be careful.

08:28.074 --> 08:29.837
Thanks to Toshitsugu...

08:31.545 --> 08:35.003
I'm certain that
Chishiki no Guuji is dead.

08:35.549 --> 08:38.780
And Ryusai died as well.

08:39.486 --> 08:42.887
But I didn't see him die
with my own eyes.

08:43.323 --> 08:44.756
Besides...

08:44.858 --> 08:48.089
where you said Ryusai
had perished...

08:48.628 --> 08:49.890
We found nothing.

08:50.897 --> 08:53.457
Yet, Rikugou is sure...

08:53.500 --> 08:56.628
that the voice he heard
was Ryusai's.

08:57.404 --> 09:00.498
I still say they're dead and
I'd stake my life on it...

09:00.874 --> 09:02.442
I saw Ryusai's body...

09:02.442 --> 09:05.172
lying right there before
I lost consciousness.

09:05.278 --> 09:06.413
If that's true,

09:06.413 --> 09:08.982
then could someone
have taken his body?

09:08.982 --> 09:10.381
Why is that so?

09:49.122 --> 09:50.885
Open the door.

09:51.791 --> 09:53.224
To the underworld?

09:53.593 --> 09:56.994
Open the door,
let the wind blow through.

09:57.797 --> 09:59.560
If it's opened...

10:02.802 --> 10:04.292
It's all right, Kai...

10:04.571 --> 10:06.266
I'll do it right.

10:07.807 --> 10:09.109
Kazane...

10:09.109 --> 10:11.543
Our longtime hope...

10:11.645 --> 10:16.378
especially for your own desire,
blast the portal.

10:17.384 --> 10:18.852
Abe no Seimei...

10:18.852 --> 10:21.116
and the evil spirit Touda...

10:21.388 --> 10:23.515
You'll pay dearly...

10:23.723 --> 10:25.122
...for your sins!

10:40.407 --> 10:41.965
Hey, Mokkun.

10:42.275 --> 10:44.800
Wait up, Mokkun!

10:44.844 --> 10:47.404
Wait for me!
Where are you going?

10:49.649 --> 10:52.641
What is this?
Hey wait for me, Mokkun!

10:53.119 --> 10:57.351
Mokkun, you mononoke!
I know you can hear me!

10:59.960 --> 11:01.689
What's that?

11:04.397 --> 11:05.865
Don't go...

11:05.865 --> 11:08.231
Don't go, Guren!

11:18.845 --> 11:21.746
Hey, what on earth
are you doing?

11:25.719 --> 11:27.550
Did you have a dream?

11:29.122 --> 11:31.556
The dreams of onmyouji
usually mean something.

11:32.425 --> 11:34.950
But sometimes,
they're just regular dreams.

11:35.729 --> 11:38.960
And you won't know
until the dream comes true.

11:42.869 --> 11:44.427
Mokkun...

11:44.537 --> 11:47.404
Why are you in a form
of mononoke?

11:49.676 --> 11:51.940
It's easier to stay with you
if I'm small.

11:52.479 --> 11:56.383
Can't you just be invisible
like Rikugou and Seiryuu?

11:56.383 --> 11:58.248
If I did, you won't
be able to see me.

11:59.019 --> 12:01.354
But I'd know you are there.

12:01.354 --> 12:04.016
But it's better if
you see me.

12:06.726 --> 12:09.251
It's good to be able
to see you.

12:09.729 --> 12:11.865
Don't you have work tomorrow?

12:11.865 --> 12:14.299
You better get back
to sleep now.

12:20.140 --> 12:23.510
Oh no!
The sun is up already!

12:23.510 --> 12:25.501
I'll be late!

12:29.716 --> 12:32.082
Okay, I'm done!
See you later!

12:32.185 --> 12:33.820
See you later.

12:33.820 --> 12:35.221
I'd better hurry!

12:35.221 --> 12:36.688
Masahiro!

12:37.757 --> 12:39.019
Grandfather.

12:39.292 --> 12:40.782
What is it?

12:45.065 --> 12:47.363
Looks like you're going to
lose something.

12:48.368 --> 12:50.003
Is this for real?

12:50.003 --> 12:51.334
What's wrong?

12:51.671 --> 12:53.298
Toshitsugu said the
same thing.

12:55.141 --> 12:57.410
It bothers me!

12:57.410 --> 12:59.844
He said the same thing
that Seimei did!

12:59.946 --> 13:02.642
That means it's imprinted
deeply on your face.

13:02.716 --> 13:05.412
You'd better be very careful.

13:13.927 --> 13:16.129
Oh good, it's still here.

13:16.129 --> 13:18.825
As for the other things
I might lose...

13:23.403 --> 13:25.271
Masahiro, have you heard?

13:25.271 --> 13:28.069
Toshitsugu called in
sick today!

13:28.141 --> 13:29.733
They said he finally collapsed.

13:31.978 --> 13:33.002
What's wrong?

13:33.580 --> 13:34.569
Nothing.

13:34.948 --> 13:36.074
Okay.

13:38.218 --> 13:42.951
I'm so happy that I won't have to
see his face all day today!

13:44.057 --> 13:48.426
Father and Mother think that
Atsuyasu's cuter, don't they?

13:49.562 --> 13:53.293
Because they always
go to Atsuyasu...

13:53.399 --> 13:56.266
but never come to me.

13:56.803 --> 14:00.102
Princess Nagako is
very mature...

14:00.306 --> 14:02.740
They know you'll be fine
even if they leave you alone.

14:04.177 --> 14:07.408
I envy... Atsuyasu.

14:08.047 --> 14:10.208
Are you feeling lonely?

14:11.851 --> 14:14.120
I won't tell anybody.

14:14.120 --> 14:18.216
Tell me your true feeling.

14:18.424 --> 14:19.448
But...

14:19.893 --> 14:22.726
I won't think you're selfish.

14:23.196 --> 14:25.960
Tell me what you want.

14:30.136 --> 14:33.697
She used to be
my mother...

14:34.140 --> 14:37.477
She's the
crown prince's mother too.

14:37.477 --> 14:41.648
She's my mother!
She belongs only to me!

14:41.648 --> 14:44.082
I don't want Atsuyasu!

14:45.385 --> 14:48.616
Prince Atsuyasu is the only one
you don't want?

14:48.955 --> 14:51.391
Even if Prince Atsuyasu
were to disappear,

14:51.391 --> 14:55.395
you'd still have other brothers
to contend with.

14:55.395 --> 14:58.631
Princess, your father is
the Emperor after all.

14:58.631 --> 15:02.032
He'll always want a son
to succeed him.

15:12.979 --> 15:14.810
My dear princess.

15:14.848 --> 15:18.648
I will fulfill your wish.

15:42.175 --> 15:43.335
What the...

15:43.376 --> 15:44.673
This is?

15:47.480 --> 15:48.947
The north star...

15:49.048 --> 15:50.242
It's overshadowed!

15:51.117 --> 15:53.551
The north star represents
the Emperor...

15:53.586 --> 15:56.453
That means something will
happen to him!

15:57.991 --> 16:00.619
It's the same as
what happened back then.

16:02.795 --> 16:03.784
It's miasma.

16:04.063 --> 16:05.052
What?

16:05.265 --> 16:08.462
Miasma is blowing out
somewhere in the capital.

16:08.735 --> 16:10.203
If it gets any stronger,

16:10.203 --> 16:15.607
it will undermine the mind and body
of all living things in this world.

16:16.342 --> 16:19.607
Rikugou, Genbu, Taiin.

16:22.115 --> 16:24.208
Seek out the source
of this evil.

16:24.417 --> 16:25.247
Understood!

16:25.485 --> 16:27.180
Let's go...!

16:31.024 --> 16:32.821
Grandfather!

16:33.626 --> 16:35.787
Was that Taiin
I just saw leaving?

16:35.929 --> 16:37.797
Rikugou and Genbu
are with her too.

16:37.797 --> 16:40.934
I sent them to find the source
of this miasma.

16:40.934 --> 16:43.903
Miasma... That explains
the awful feeling I've got.

16:43.903 --> 16:48.237
Masahiro... get ready to
enter the palace.

16:48.875 --> 16:51.644
Yoshimasa's on duty at
the palace today...

16:51.644 --> 16:54.347
He should've noticed
the presence of the aura...

16:54.347 --> 16:56.008
If you hear any news...

16:56.049 --> 16:57.914
I'll tell you right away!

17:06.092 --> 17:07.320
Ouch!

17:07.527 --> 17:09.427
Taiin, where are we?

17:09.629 --> 17:11.221
Between second street
and Kitsuji.

17:11.631 --> 17:14.267
The aura has the highest
concentration level here.

17:14.267 --> 17:15.757
Ouch...

17:24.210 --> 17:26.110
What's that?!

17:26.212 --> 17:28.915
It must be a demon
that lives around the area.

17:28.915 --> 17:31.611
The aura must have
transformed it into that!

17:32.318 --> 17:34.149
Don't get any closer!

17:41.361 --> 17:43.192
Don't interfere with
my plans!

17:50.169 --> 17:52.763
You forced open the door
to the underworld?

17:52.805 --> 17:55.638
You do live up to expectation,
Rikugou...

17:55.942 --> 17:58.502
But even you wouldn't know
where the portal is...

17:58.578 --> 18:01.047
Because I've opened
more than one door.

18:01.047 --> 18:03.750
But how? It already takes
a tremendous amount of power...

18:03.750 --> 18:06.014
just to open one door!

18:10.790 --> 18:14.191
A shikigami isn't allowed
to harm a human being.

18:14.360 --> 18:16.885
So what are you going
to do, Rikugou?

18:22.668 --> 18:25.831
Don't mess with us!

18:42.422 --> 18:43.946
Did I get him?

18:44.057 --> 18:45.456
I think so.

18:56.269 --> 18:57.793
What is this?

18:57.904 --> 18:59.201
Give it back!

19:03.810 --> 19:05.368
Let go of me!

19:17.223 --> 19:19.157
Compassion for your enemy?

19:19.392 --> 19:23.328
You're the only one here...
who sees yourself as our enemy.

19:24.330 --> 19:29.927
Don't you think that the person
behind is just using you?

19:32.472 --> 19:35.441
Don't listen to them.

19:36.142 --> 19:38.133
That... voice...

19:38.211 --> 19:40.577
I know, that's Ryusai's voice.

19:41.881 --> 19:43.508
Master...

19:44.817 --> 19:48.309
Too slow...
You are all too slow.

19:48.387 --> 19:51.948
The wind from the underworld
will envelop the whole capital.

19:52.125 --> 19:55.617
The descendants of heaven
will die under its curse!

19:56.229 --> 19:58.060
What the!

20:16.182 --> 20:17.740
Father!

20:17.917 --> 20:19.043
Masahiro...

20:19.185 --> 20:21.854
So you've noticed the shadowing
of the north star too.

20:21.854 --> 20:23.222
Yes.

20:23.222 --> 20:26.123
Grandfather sent me here
to see if I could help.

20:26.626 --> 20:29.862
I've already sent my petition
to the deity of Onmyou...

20:29.862 --> 20:32.558
Hopefully I'll get
some kind of answer soon.

20:34.033 --> 20:37.764
Lord Yoshimasa! The Emperor
and her Ladyship are...

20:44.043 --> 20:45.135
Oh well...

20:45.478 --> 20:48.047
Grandfather... the Emperor...

20:48.047 --> 20:50.216
He's collapsed, hasn't he?

20:50.216 --> 20:51.513
How did you know?

20:51.584 --> 20:56.656
Someone has put a curse
on the Emperor, his concubine...

20:56.656 --> 20:59.022
and even his children.

20:59.325 --> 21:01.987
Masa... hiro...

21:08.301 --> 21:09.461
Hey!

21:09.569 --> 21:11.036
Akiko!

21:11.270 --> 21:12.259
Akiko!

21:12.705 --> 21:15.408
- Oh no!
- What's wrong, Akiko!

21:15.408 --> 21:17.899
Wake up, Akiko!

21:19.478 --> 21:22.879
In time, the heavens will
fall under my control.

21:23.316 --> 21:25.682
And the throne of the Emperor
will be...

21:42.935 --> 21:54.413
Everyone, as time passes,
loses sight of his dreams

21:54.413 --> 22:05.725
Errors and pains are repeated
through the ages

22:05.725 --> 22:11.464
Why do we resist believing
in each other?

22:11.464 --> 22:17.061
Why do we put out
the light of fate?

22:19.272 --> 22:29.582
I want to protect our future
with this hand

22:29.582 --> 22:36.389
Because you taught me

22:36.389 --> 22:41.627
What it means to challenge
with all my strength

22:41.627 --> 22:47.433
You will keep overcoming
your limits

22:47.433 --> 22:54.532
Surely surely surely

22:59.779 --> 23:02.680
Next Episode

23:23.969 --> 23:25.638
Next on Shonen Onmyouji...

23:25.638 --> 23:26.772
Episode 20.

23:26.772 --> 23:26.939
Episode 20
Chasing the Winds of Invitation,
onto Underworld
Episode 20.

23:26.939 --> 23:26.972
Episode 20
Chasing the Winds of Invitation,
onto Underworld

23:26.972 --> 23:29.236
Episode 20
Chasing the Winds of Invitation,
onto Underworld
Chasing the Winds of Invitation,
onto Underworld.
